        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/cc309b84dc53f74c60d8dc1a4b8ca9c5.poster.avif?t=1787860251\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/cc309b84dc53f74c60d8dc1a4b8ca9c5.webm?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/cc309b84dc53f74c60d8dc1a4b8ca9c5.mp4?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Beatrice Hearthorne, a lone apothecary travelling through a plague-stricken realm.</strong> Race against time to heal suffering townsfolk as you test your skills, manage your resources, and make impossible choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/35223193a74cc8607b922b26f2dd3d22.poster.avif?t=1787860251\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/35223193a74cc8607b922b26f2dd3d22.webm?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/35223193a74cc8607b922b26f2dd3d22.mp4?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time is Running Out</strong>. Explore procedurally generated environments to gather essential ingredients, craft life-saving remedies and cure the afflicted before time runs out. Balance your priorities carefully; every second spent is a moment someone grows weaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/e3555b606ea3c9aae82e6325e27f1a69.poster.avif?t=1787860251\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/e3555b606ea3c9aae82e6325e27f1a69.webm?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/e3555b606ea3c9aae82e6325e27f1a69.mp4?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Crafting System</strong>. Master a variety of minigames to create your cures. Brew potions, weave bandages, prepare meals, and more to aid the afflicted. Your skill directly impacts remedy quality. Only the finest cures can save those succumbing to the most severe afflictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/5197c1b64aff19d71c344f3f6ce08644.poster.avif?t=1787860251\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/5197c1b64aff19d71c344f3f6ce08644.webm?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/5197c1b64aff19d71c344f3f6ce08644.mp4?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression with RPG Depth</strong>. Select temporary blessings from the divine to aid your ventures. Each upgrade gives you an advantage in your race against the clock. Fail and lose your materials, but keep your experience and coin to permanently upgrade Beatrice's skills and equipment. Every run makes you stronger for the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/214ecfc76c995b68034e19e0d2e47d8a.poster.avif?t=1787860251\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/214ecfc76c995b68034e19e0d2e47d8a.webm?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/214ecfc76c995b68034e19e0d2e47d8a.mp4?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Struggle against an ever encroaching plague.</strong> Follow Beatrice's journey as a lethal plague creeps into the kingdom of Aeldenfield and overturns her world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/0dfaf5a053eee3268a26c9723fd1d2ac.poster.avif?t=1787860251\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/0dfaf5a053eee3268a26c9723fd1d2ac.webm?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696200/extras/0dfaf5a053eee3268a26c9723fd1d2ac.mp4?t=1787860251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Combat Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active Gathering</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Crafting Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable Tools and Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessing System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.5D Art style</p></li></ul>",
